        {
          "uuid": "61821163-789c-5e9b-8ff3-431840502eb1",
          "title": "Office macro antivirus (AMSI) scanning is enabled",
          "description": "Verifies MacroRuntimeScanScope is set to scan macros, which is how Office hands macro content to AMSI. It does not verify that an AMSI provider is actually registered and healthy, nor that the antivirus behind it is running with current signatures -- so a pass means Office is configured to offer macros for scanning, not that scanning is effective.",
