        {
          "uuid": "de54e675-16e5-5c81-8b22-2aab9d985f5d",
          "title": "Office policy blocks macros in files originating from the internet",
          "description": "Verifies the ADMX policy state that implements the block, in machine scope and in every loaded user policy hive. It does NOT observe runtime blocking behaviour, does not detect Mark-of-the-Web being stripped by an upstream mail or file gateway, does not cover Office applications outside in_scope_apps, and cannot assess user profile hives that were not loaded at collection time.",
