        {
          "uuid": "b95c9d8f-d0f9-576b-beb6-0cc5dc0c1bf9",
          "title": "Office macros are disabled for users without a demonstrated business requirement",
          "description": "Checks that VBAWarnings is set to 4 (disable all macros without notification) by policy. It CANNOT assess the \"demonstrated business requirement\" half of the control at all -- whether a user who has macros enabled is authorised is an organisational fact held outside the host. A pass here means macros are disabled, not that the exemption process is sound; a fail may be a legitimately approved exemption.",
